          <mxGeometry height="36" width="216" x="448.5" y="46.980000000000004" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="VzAw25nOq-CT2ZhzkMRU-3" parent="hZsKiYdVrp9ALZoW2wGT-1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;autosize=1;resizable=0;" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;2. Attachment Arm Wiring System&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="36" width="234" x="445.5" y="70.98" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="VzAw25nOq-CT2ZhzkMRU-5" parent="hZsKiYdVrp9ALZoW2wGT-1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;autosize=1;resizable=0;" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;The block diagram in this section presents a &lt;span data-start=&quot;2442&quot; data-end=&quot;2476&quot;&gt;high-level functional overview&lt;/span&gt; using simplified&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;geometric shapes to&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;represent major subsystems without detailing individual pin connections.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="48" width="606" x="460.5" y="97.98" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
