        <mxCell id="0dJouEwTj-KPGEEr4rTx-1" parent="1" style="shape=note;size=20;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=center;perimeterSpacing=3;spacingLeft=11;spacingRight=16;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;Notes:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;1. The mode used for this encoder is &lt;strong data-start=&quot;37&quot; data-end=&quot;74&quot;&gt;Basic TTL output&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;(based on the encoder instruction manual).&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;2.&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); text-align: center;&quot;&gt;The encoder output requires an external &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;576&quot; data-end=&quot;602&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); text-align: center;&quot;&gt;4.7kΩ pull-up resistor&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); text-align: center;&quot;&gt; on the A and B signal lines because the encoder output type behaves as an &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;677&quot; data-end=&quot;708&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); text-align: center;&quot;&gt;open collector (NPN) output&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;677&quot; data-end=&quot;708&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); text-align: center;&quot;&gt;3. &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-start=&quot;677&quot; data-end=&quot;708&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); text-align: center;&quot;&gt;To install the encoder onto the motor shaft, &lt;b&gt;a custom encoder mounting bracket&lt;/b&gt; is required (the design for this mounting bracket is available in the referenced document)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="305.88" width="200" x="126" y="436.06" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
